    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PASS, People Are Seriously Slow! The endless driving game where the only goal is to overtake every slow driver in your way. How many cars can you PASS? You'll be saying &quot;I can make that gap!&quot; as you just barely swerve back over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Car Cosmetics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedometer Needle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering Wheel Cover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hood Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hood Art Color</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash Trophy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car Color</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Scores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save up to 5 High Scores locally. Just set a new High Score and input your initials with the onscreen keyboard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of that car driving driving slow in front of you? Blow your horn! Will it do anything? No, but it will make you feel better!</p>",
